        </div>

        <h1 class="hero__headline">
          <span class="hero__headline-line">
            <span class="hero__headline-word">Expertise</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hero__headline-line">
            <span class="hero__headline-word">environ&shy;ne&shy;mentale</span>
          </span>
          <span class="hero__headline-line">
            <span class="hero__headline-word">en <em>Afrique.</em></span>
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero__sub" id="heroSub">
          L'expertise de pointe pour une Afrique résiliente et décarbonée. Droit de l'environnement, marchés carbone, gestion des catastrophes.
        </p>

        <div class="hero__actions" id="heroActions">
          <a href="services.html" class="btn btn--primary">
            <span>Découvrir nos services</span>
            <span class="btn__arrow">→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn--ghost">
            Nous contacter
          </a>
